cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite BioDataLink and the original datasets.
type: software
title: BioDataLink
abstract: >-
  A Wolfram Language paclet for discovering biological data sources, searching
  public study metadata, verifying file downloads and reading supported local
  measurements with explicit identifiers and provenance.
authors:
  - name: Wolfram Institute
    website: https://wolframinstitute.org
license: MIT
version: 0.3.1
date-released: 2026-11-04
repository-code: https://github.com/WolframInstitute/BioDataLink
url: https://github.com/WolframInstitute/BioDataLink
keywords:
  - biological data
  - single-cell data
  - perturbation data
  - provenance
  - Wolfram Language
